Step 1: Verify AWS Configuration
Check AWS Identity
aws sts get-caller-identity

Output:

Account: 426449772516
Region: us-east-1
Step 2: Create Dockerfiles
Backend Dockerfile

Location:

backend/dockerfile
FROM python:3.10

WORKDIR /app

COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt

COPY . .

CMD ["python", "app.py"]
Frontend Dockerfile

Location:

frontend/dockerfile
FROM node:18

WORKDIR /app

COPY package.json .
RUN npm install

COPY . .

CMD ["node", "server.js"]
Step 3: Create ECR Repositories

Terraform created:

tutedude-backend
tutedude-frontend

Verify:

aws ecr describe-repositories \
--region us-east-1
