Step 5: Build and Push Backend Image
Commands executed on EC2Tfm
cd ~/tutedude-devops/backend

Build image:

docker build -t tutedude-backend .

Tag image:

docker tag tutedude-backend:latest \
426449772516.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tutedude-backend:latest

Push image:

docker push \
426449772516.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tutedude-backend:latest
Step 6: Build and Push Frontend Image
